619
00:42:01,041 --> 00:42:02,107
Meu Deus, Matty!

620
00:42:02,142 --> 00:42:03,210
Jesus! Matty!

621
00:42:10,886 --> 00:42:11,885
Meu Deus.

622
00:42:23,366 --> 00:42:25,032
Tem alguém aí?

623
