650
00:44:31,037 --> 00:44:32,971
Que porra era aquilo?

651
00:44:33,006 --> 00:44:34,490
Eles levaram ela, cara!

652
00:44:34,525 --> 00:44:35,974
Eles levaram ela, porra!

653
00:44:36,009 --> 00:44:37,574
Estamos fudidos!

654
00:44:37,609 --> 00:44:38,677
Estamos no meio do nada...

655
00:44:38,712 --> 00:44:39,478
Seth, calma.

656
00:44:39,513 --> 00:44:40,243
Não!

657
00:44:40,278 --> 00:44:41,346
Não toque em mim, está bem?

658
00:44:41,381 --> 00:44:42,512
